+
+## Amendment: pool the metamorphic sample's cases (2026-11-14, #1749)
+
+The default metamorphic sample already selects cases through caseShard.
+Its check:fast test-file job now expands into pooledParts(cores) jobs,
+each with one RUST_JS_CASES partition. The file identity comes from
+iteratorSlice's existing runs.metamorphic catalog. The same file-job
+builder serves the full check, plain suites and explicit files; an
+explicit file already scheduled is not duplicated. No case, rewrite,
+coverage gate or timeout is removed.
+
+A planning regression proves all parts occur exactly once on one-, four-
+and twelve-core machine plans, including an explicit file requested
+alongside --all. This changes scheduling only, ADR 0262 case A.
